  "description": "Wang Dam left his hometown and came to Seoul without a plan. In order to receive settlement funds, he had to be the top student in his entire school! However, the school he was transferring to was a so-called 'hard-working' school filled with the worst students who only bothered him when he studied... Will Wang Dam be able to become the top student in his entire school in the worst environment?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
